00:16:12,000 --> 00:16:18,000
The DC Animated Movie Universe (DCAMU) is  an American media franchise and shared
universe of animated films distributed between 2013 and 2024 by Warner Bros.

13
00:17:33,000 --> 00:17:39,000
Animation and DC Entertainment.

14
00:18:54,000 --> 00:19:00,000
Based on characters from the DC Universe (DC Comics), the franchise is
part of the DC Universe Animated Original Movies line.

15
00:20:15,000 --> 00:20:21,000
The main film series are split into two story arcs with different continuities.

16
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:42,000
The first story arc began in 2013 with Justice League: The Flashpoint Paradox and ended in 2020 with Justice League Dark: Apokolips War, while the second story arc, nicknamed
the "Tomorrowverse", began later that year with Superman: Man of Tomorrow and concluded in 2024 with the Justice League: Crisis on Infinite Earths trilogy.

17
00:22:57,000 --> 00:23:03,000
The franchise comprises 25 films overall, with tie-in media including
5 short films, one web series and two digital comics.

18
00:24:18,000 --> 00:24:24,000
The film explores themes of magic, superhero,
vertigo, supernatural, haunted house.

19
00:25:39,000 --> 00:25:45,000
The tone is dark.
